{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a pair of jeans positioned on the left side of the image. For every glove present in the scene, it is visually smaller than the jeans, and there is a specific column of items arranged above it: a drill is located above the glove, a bottle is above the drill, a pair of scissors is above the bottle, and a pan is positioned above the scissors.",
